  "description": {
    "text": "Half of the Gift Box Emerald ver., a set themed on Pokémon Emerald and released on 19 November 2004. The box held two ready-built half decks, the Deoxys deck and the Rayquaza deck (the official page describes them by their Groudon and Kyogre), eight sideboard cards for changing the decks (two of them holo), two half playmats, a coin, damage counters and markers, and a guide to playing and building decks. This set is the Rayquaza deck: its 19 numbered cards include Kyogre and Rayquaza ex, played with Water, Lightning and Fire Energy.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: ギフトボックス エメラルドver.",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20081120210720/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/pcg/pcg_12.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Gift Box Emerald (TCG)",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Gift_Box_Emerald_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A blue keyhole-figure symbol at the bottom right, and a number out of 019",
